Title: MOVIE ABC
Author: Test Writer
Draft date: 08/09/2026

FADE IN:

INT. RAJ'S OFFICE - DAY #12#

RAJ (35), an architect in a navy blazer, stares at a model of a tower. His phone buzzes.

RAJ
Not now.

INT. RESTAURANT - NIGHT #24#

A candle-lit table. PRIYA (30), red dress, statement earrings, waits. Raj arrives in a white shirt, sleeves rolled.

PRIYA
You're late.

RAJ
(sitting)
Traffic. And a small building collapse.

A WAITER in a black vest pours water. INSPECTOR PANDEY, khaki uniform, enters and scans the room.

INSPECTOR PANDEY
Mr. Raj Malhotra?

RAJ (CONT'D)
That depends who's asking.

CUT TO:

EXT. RESTAURANT - PARKING LOT - CONTINUOUS #25#

Rain. Raj and Priya run to the car, Raj's shirt now soaked.

PRIYA (V.O.)
I should have known then.

INT. HOSPITAL CORRIDOR - NIGHT #32#

Raj, in the blood-stained white shirt from the fight, waits under fluorescent light. RAJ'S MOTHER (62) rushes in, cream saree.

RAJ'S MOTHER
What have you done?

FADE OUT.
